<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Future Mall</title>
    <style>
        :root{
            --primary-color: #ff6600;
            --secondary-color: #333;
            --background-color: #eeeeee;
            --text-color: #fff;
        }

        *{
            transition: all 0.5s;
            font-family: cursive;
            animation: onload 1s;
        }

        body{
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background-color: var(--background-color);
            margin: 0;
        }

        h1{
            color: var(--secondary-color);
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0 20px;
            font-size: 3rem;
        }

        ul{
            display:grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5,1fr);
        }
        @media screen and (max-width: 600px){
            ul{
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
            }
        }

        @keyframes onload{
            0%{
                transform: scale(0);
                opacity: 0;
            }
            100%{
                transform: scale(1);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        ul li{
            list-style: none;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: var(--text-color);
            margin: 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        img{
            display: block;
            margin: 20px auto;
        }

        footer{
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: var(--secondary-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin-top: auto;
        }

        ul li:hover{
            transform: scale(1.1);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        #ctrl{
            display: block;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        p{
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Future Mall</h1>
    <p>Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Nihil id illo, mollitia debitis vitae voluptatibus inventore, explicabo nemo, itaque quisquam rem recusandae voluptatum. Autem amet pariatur laudantium! Velit, iste dolor!</p>
    <div id="container">
        <ul id="menu">
            <li>Burger King</li>
            <li>McDonald's</li>
            <li>KFC</li>
            <li>Subway</li>
            <li>Pizza Hut</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <img src="" id="logo" width="200px" height="200px">
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Future Mall. All rights reserved. Made by Mark Richard</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
